<!--
  Replaces the file the crop library ships, which maps its provider onto the whole of
  cacheDir, the whole private files dir and the external files dir.

  This app never hands out one of that provider's URIs: the crop screen passes saveUri
  = null, so the library writes nothing and shares nothing. Overriding the mapping here
  means that even if some future call did create such a URI, the provider would have
  nothing to serve - the export archives and the import staging area, which between them
  hold every relative's name, number and photo, are not reachable through it.
-->
